{"lesson_uid":"L0020","_provenance":{"generator":"backend/scripts/generate_lesson_zhuyin.py","reading_authority":"frontend/src/components/zhuyin/polyphonicProcessor.ts（跑，非移植）","source_font":"frontend/public/fonts/BpmfZihiSerif-Regular.ttf","font_sha256_16":"fc25a90d27699ec4","poyin_db_sha256_16":"882bc0ae69aeef35","notation":"pypinyin BopomofoConverter（與 font_readings.json 同一個轉換器）","stats":{"texts":226,"chars":5756,"poly_positions":1605,"he_adjudicated":1,"manual_corrections":0}},"texts":[{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"6xkpp","idx":1,"text":"在和別人說話時，有時候我會覺得自己好像有一點讀心術。別人的話還沒說完，我就先猜到對方後面可能要接什麼。","n":51,"ssz":".1............1.....2.............................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"6xkpp","idx":2,"text":"像朋友對我說：「這部電影我也很想看，但是……」我心裡可能馬上想：「糟了，他是不是不能跟我一起去？」又或者，老師對我說：「你作業上的字寫得很工整，但是……」我也會有點緊張，心想：「後面是不是要提醒我哪裡要改？」","n":104,"ssz":"......................................1.....2......................1........................1..........."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"6xkpp","idx":3,"text":"不過，「但是」後面也不一定都是壞消息。像朋友說：「我今天有點累，但是我還是想聽你說話。」聽到這裡，我就會知道，前面是在說他的狀況，後面才是他真正想告訴我的心意。","n":80,"ssz":"1..........1...................................................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"6xkpp","idx":4,"text":"你也有過這種感覺嗎？這不是因為我們真的會讀心，而是因為「但是」像一個小路標。它提醒我們：話要轉彎了，「但是」後面的話可能才是對方最想說的重點。我前陣子就有過一次很難忘的經驗。","n":87,"ssz":"...........1..1...........1......1........................................1............"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"6xkpp","idx":5,"text":"那時候，我一直想和班上的小恩變熟，有天放學，我終於鼓起勇氣問她：「星期六我們一起去圖書館讀書好嗎？」小恩低下頭，想了一下，慢慢的說：「我們認識還沒有很久……」","n":79,"ssz":".....2..1.............................2...................1...................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"6xkpp","idx":6,"text":"完了，這聽起來不像是好消息。她又說：「我也還不太了解你……」我更緊張了，接下來她會婉拒我嗎？沒想到，小恩居然接著說：「但是，我覺得一起去圖書館應該還不錯。」","n":78,"ssz":".......1..............1.1.......................................12........1..."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"6xkpp","idx":7,"text":"聽到這裡，我在心裡吶喊「YES！」原來，小恩不是不想答應我，她只是先說出自己的顧慮，「但是」後面的話，才是她真正的回答。「但是」就像一個轉彎的路口，轉過彎後，能讓我們看見截然不同的風景與結局。","n":96,"ssz":"......................1...11.......................................1............................"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"6xkpp","idx":8,"text":"後來我發現，讀文章也是一樣。作者常常把重要的話放在「可是、但是、不過、然而」這些「轉折詞」後面。例如：\n失敗雖然很丟臉，可是失敗也能提醒我們，下次怎麼改進。\n燕麥奶拿鐵有點貴，一杯75元，但是實在超好喝的。\n我原本想去打籃球，不過突然下起大雨，只好留在家裡。\n他每天都很認真複習，然而這次考試還是考砸了。","n":152,"ssz":"...........1....................1.......................................................2........................1......................................"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"6xkpp","idx":9,"text":"發現了嗎？轉折詞前面的句子，會讓人心裡自然產生一個「照常理，接下來應該……」的預期或猜測，但轉折詞一出現，就像一個急轉彎，讓人有「咦，怎麼跟想的不一樣」的感覺，出現「出乎意料」的結果。而整個句子中，作者特別想說的話，常常會出現在轉折詞之後。","n":120,"ssz":"............1...........1........................2......1................1....................1.1......................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"6xkpp","idx":10,"text":"所以，不論是聽人說話，還是讀一篇文章，只要出現「可是、但是、不過、然而」這樣的轉折詞，你就知道，轉彎路標來了。跟著這些小路標看下去，先留意後面的話，再配合前後文，常常就能更快掌握重要訊息。","n":94,"ssz":"...1..........................1..............................................................."},{"section":"key_reading","slug":"m47w4","idx":null,"text":"後來我發現，讀文章也是一樣。作者常常把重要的話放在「可是、但是、不過、然而」這些「轉折詞」後面。例如：\n失敗雖然很丟臉，可是失敗也能提醒我們，下次怎麼改進。\n燕麥奶拿鐵有點貴，一杯75元，但是實在超好喝的。\n我原本想去打籃球，不過突然下起大雨，只好留在家裡。\n他每天都很認真複習，然而這次考試還是考砸了。發現了嗎？轉折詞前面的句子，會讓人心裡自然產生一個「照常理，接下來應該……」的預期或猜測，但轉折詞一出現，就像一個急轉彎，讓人有「咦，怎麼跟想的不一樣」的感覺，出現「出乎意料」的結果。而整個句子中，作者特別想說的話，常常會出現在轉折詞之後。所以，不論是聽人說話，還是讀一篇文章，只要出現「可是、但是、不過、然而」這樣的轉折詞，你就知道，轉彎路標來了。跟著這些小路標看下去，先留意後面的話，再配合前後文，常常就能更快掌握重要訊息。","n":366,"ssz":"...........1....................1.......................................................2........................1..................................................1...........1........................2......1................1....................1.1..........................1..........................1..............................................................."},{"section":"served:series","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一般","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"跟著「但是」轉個彎","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:genre","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"說明文","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"解題策略──轉折詞後有重點","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課我們要練習的是，聽或看的時候，要特別注意「但是」後面說了什麼，因為那通常是真正重要的想法\n這篇文章裡，作者就用了很多「但是」來告訴我們，它有多厲害，就像一個提醒我們要注意的新路標\n所以讀的時候，記得看到「但是」、「可是」、「不過」這些詞，就要豎起耳朵、睜大眼睛，看看接下來出現了什麼重點喔","n":147,"ssz":".1.................................1............................................1....................1.............1...........1..................1"},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課我們要練習的是，聽或看的時候，要特別注意「但是」後面說了什麼，因為那通常是真正重要的想法","n":47,"ssz":".1.................................1..........."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章裡，作者就用了很多「但是」來告訴我們，它有多厲害，就像一個提醒我們要注意的新路標","n":44,"ssz":"................................1..........."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"所以讀的時候，記得看到「但是」、「可是」、「不過」這些詞，就要豎起耳朵、睜大眼睛，看看接下來出現了什麼重點喔","n":54,"ssz":"........1.............1...........1..................1"},{"section":"served:intro.background","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章要帶大家認識一個很特別的詞：「但是」。作者透過生活中的對話和自己的親身經驗，說明了「但是」這個詞在說話和閱讀時扮演的重要角色。當我們聽到「但是」時，它就像一個路標，提醒我們話語或想法即將轉彎，而轉彎之後的內容，往往才是說話者或作者真正想表達的重點。文章也舉例說明，在閱讀時，留意「但是」、「可是」、「不過」、「然而」等轉折詞後面的句子，能幫助我們更快抓住文章的核心訊息。","n":189,"ssz":"...........1.....................1................1....1........1.................1.......................................................................1...............1.................."},{"section":"served:paragraphs[7]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"後來我發現，讀文章也是一樣。作者常常把重要的話放在「可是、但是、不過、然而」這些「轉折詞」後面。例如：","n":51,"ssz":"...........1....................1.................."},{"section":"served:paragraphs[7]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"失敗雖然很丟臉，可是失敗也能提醒我們，下次怎麼改進。","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:paragraphs[7]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"燕麥奶拿鐵有點貴，一杯75元，但是實在超好喝的。","n":24,"ssz":".........2.............."},{"section":"served:paragraphs[7]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我原本想去打籃球，不過突然下起大雨，只好留在家裡。","n":25,"ssz":".........1..............."},{"section":"served:paragraphs[7]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他每天都很認真複習，然而這次考試還是考砸了。","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀全文-做記號","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"念順順","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞我最棒","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞應用","n":4,"ssz":"..1."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"五","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文章重點表","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"六","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀聚光燈","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].subtitle","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"解題策略——轉折詞後有重點","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"七","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀理解","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"八","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"詞語複習","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[0].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"婉拒","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[0].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"用有禮貌的方式拒絕別人。","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[1].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"常理","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[1].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一般人都知道、都認同的道理。","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"吶喊","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"大聲喊叫。","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"預期","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在事情發生前，先想到或猜測可能的情況。","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"顧慮","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"對某件事情感到擔心。","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"工整","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"整齊、端正。","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀心術","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"知道別人在想什麼的能力，也用來形容很了解別人的想法。","n":26,"ssz":"..................1......."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"路標","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"用來告訴大家方向或地點的標誌。","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"出乎意料","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"事情的結果和原本想的不一樣。","n":14,"ssz":".....1.....1.."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[9].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"截然不同","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[9].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"完全不一樣，差別很大。","n":11,"ssz":"...1......."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[0].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"面對銷售員熱情的招呼，她微笑著（　）了對方的推銷。","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[1].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"外面下著大雨，他卻沒有帶傘就出門，實在不合（　）。","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[2].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"好朋友相處久了，好像都會有（　），一個眼神就知道彼此的想法。","n":30,"ssz":"...1..............1..........."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[3].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這次跨年級英語競賽的結果（　），經驗最少的新生隊竟然獲勝了。","n":30,"ssz":".............................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[4].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"經過朋友的鼓勵，他才終於放下心中的（　），決定嘗試看看。","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[5].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他的字寫得非常（　），老師常常拿來當作範本提供大家參考。","n":28,"ssz":"....1......................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[6].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為下雨，這週末老街的遊客比（　）的少很多。","n":22,"ssz":".1...................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[7].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這裡有許多岔路，如果沒有（　），遊客很容易迷路。","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列選項「　」中的語詞，何者使用正確？","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他為了出席這場會議，打扮得十分「工整」正式","n":21,"ssz":".1..........1........"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他熱情地「婉拒」朋友，還一直要求朋友留下來","n":21,"ssz":"...1........2.1......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"父母過世後，他一個人「顧慮」妹妹，十分辛苦","n":21,"ssz":"........1......1....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"按照「常理」，校外教學前他應該會興奮得睡不著","n":22,"ssz":"..................1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列哪一組語詞皆屬於「轉折詞」？","n":16,"ssz":"...2............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為、所以、如果、只要","n":11,"ssz":".1........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"首先、接著、然後、最後","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"可是、但是、不過、然而","n":11,"ssz":"......1...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例如、像是、可能、也許","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列何者最能作為這篇文章的主旨？","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"聽別人說話時，不應事先猜測對方接下來的話","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"接受別人的邀約前，應先說明自己的所有顧慮","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"看到轉折詞，要留意後面的訊息，並配合前後文理解","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀文章時，找到轉折詞後就不必再閱讀前面的內容","n":23,"ssz":".............1........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「很多人以為會求助就是不夠厲害，不過懂得求助，也是一種解決問題的能力。」下列何者最符合句意？","n":46,"ssz":"...........1....1..1.....2...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"懂得在適當的時候求助，也是一種解決問題的能力","n":22,"ssz":".1..1........2........"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只有能力不足的人，才會需要主動向別人尋求幫助","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"遇到問題時，先自己處理，通常比開口求助更重要","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"向別人求助雖能解決問題，卻會凸顯自己能力不足","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「撐一把有形的傘，那是正當的事，因為我們不必在雨中表現異於同類的乖張。但如果撐起一把無形的傘，使我們不去面對風雨，面對苦難，那我們永遠無法領略雨過天青的喜悅。」這段話所寄寓的道理，與下列何者最接近？（題幹引自103年會考國文第9題）","n":116,"ssz":"..2..............1..1...................2.........1.........1......................................................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人遇到困難時，應該拒絕所有保護與幫助","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"面對人生風雨時，不應只靠逃避來保護自己","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"撐傘躲雨的人，無法表現出與眾不同的勇氣","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只要避開所有苦難，就能得到雨過天青的喜悅","n":20,"ssz":".......1............"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＜190字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還要多加練習。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"191~220字","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"嗯，還不錯喲！","n":7,"ssz":"...1..."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＞221字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哇嗚，超級厲害！","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:key_reading.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請用計時器，從指定段落（八☞）開始朗讀，計時1分鐘讀的字數，並記錄在表格中。如果你計時3次後，對自己還不滿意，可以自己多練幾次喔。最後一次，找一位同學，請他來計時、記錄並簽名！","n":88,"ssz":"...............................................................1.......1................"},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.passage#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他每天都很認真複習，然而這次考試還是考砸了。發現了嗎？轉折詞前面的句子，會讓人心裡自然產生一個「照常理，接下來應該……」的預期或猜測，但轉折詞一出現，就像一個急轉彎，讓人有「咦，怎麼跟想的不一樣」的感覺，出現「出乎意料」的結果。而整個句子中，作者特別想說的話，常常會出現在轉折詞之後。所以，不論是聽人說話，還是讀一篇文章，只要出現「可是、但是、不過、然而」這樣的轉折詞，你就知道，轉彎路標來了。跟著這些小路標看下去，先留意後面的話，再配合前後文，常常就能更快掌握重要訊息。","n":236,"ssz":"..................................1...........1........................2......1................1....................1.1..........................1..........................1..............................................................."},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"後來我發現，讀文章也是一樣。作者常常把重要的話放","n":24,"ssz":"...........1............"},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"本課透過日常的對話經驗，連結到閱讀文章，提醒我們：看到轉折詞時，可以先留意後面的訊息，再配合前後文理解句意。希望同學在閱讀時能藉由留意轉折詞，更準確掌握文意。現在就讓我們一起來完成以下練習吧！","n":96,"ssz":".....................................................................................2.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、圈出轉折詞，找出作者特別強調的訊息","n":19,"ssz":"...............1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文章中常見的轉折詞有：可是、但是、不過、然而、卻。另外，「不是……而是……」也是常見的轉折句型。請在以下題目中完成任務：","n":60,"ssz":".................1...........1.............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶圈出轉折詞。\n❷讀一讀轉折詞前後的內容。\n❸勾選作者在「轉折詞之後」特別強調的訊息。","n":43,"ssz":"......................................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶圈出轉折詞。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷讀一讀轉折詞前後的內容。","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸勾選作者在「轉折詞之後」特別強調的訊息。","n":21,"ssz":"................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"很多人以為運動讓人疲累，不過適度運動反而能讓精神變好。","n":27,"ssz":"............1.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].circled_word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不過","n":2,"ssz":"1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"運動會讓人疲累。","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"適度運動能讓精神變好。","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（圖形），文字流無此資訊","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"家人已經提醒他使用手機超過約定的時間，他卻大呼小叫，仍然不肯放下手機。","n":35,"ssz":"..................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].circled_word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"卻","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"家人提醒他超過時間。","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他不肯放下手機，還大呼小叫。","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這部電影我已經看過很多次，但是每一次都還是可以發現新的細節。","n":30,"ssz":".............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].circled_word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"但是","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我已經看過很多次這部電影。","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"每次重看這部電影都有新發現。","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"氣象署已經發布大雨特報，然而還是有許多遊客前往山區。","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].circled_word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"然而","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"氣象署發布了大雨特報。","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"大雨特報已發布，許多遊客仍前往山區。","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這次報告的分數很低，不是因為資料太少，而是重點沒有整理清楚。","n":30,"ssz":"..........1..1................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].circled_word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"而是","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為資料太少所以分數低。","n":12,"ssz":".1.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為重點不清楚所以分數低。","n":13,"ssz":".1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"提醒：先看轉折詞後面說什麼，再看看前面的內容，才知道真正的重點。","n":32,"ssz":"................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、圈出轉折詞，並勾選文章的重點","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"阿凱一直給人很冷淡的感覺。下課時，他常常一個人坐在位子上，不太主動和大家聊天。有一次我忘了帶美勞用具，正不知道該怎麼辦時，阿凱卻默默把自己的剪刀和膠水推到我面前。後來我才發現，他不是不關心別人，而是比較不會主動開口。原來，有些人雖然話不多，但是不代表冷漠，他們只是用自己的方式在幫助別人。","n":144,"ssz":"..2..................1....1..1...1......................................1................1...........1....................1....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"圈出文章中的轉折詞（共三處）。","n":15,"ssz":"............1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色方框（圖形），文字流無此資訊","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"比較轉折詞前後的內容，下列何者最可能是這篇文章的主旨？","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不愛說話的人，通常不願意主動幫助同學","n":18,"ssz":"1........1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"判斷一個人時，說話方式比實際行動更重要","n":19,"ssz":"...1..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不要只憑表面判斷一個人，也要觀察他的行動","n":20,"ssz":"1........1.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"與安靜的人相處時，應該主動要求他表達想法","n":20,"ssz":".....1.......1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三、挑戰題：用策略試試會考題","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"以下為會考的歷屆試題，請先圈出轉折詞，再比較前後內容，找出作者特別強調的訊息，判斷正確答案。","n":46,"ssz":"..................................1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.111年第5題","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].items[0].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「過去賭客玩拉霸機時，需要把紙鈔塞進機器裡，所以會看見皮夾裡的鈔票越來越少，能提醒自己適時收手。但現在他們用卡片玩拉霸機，卡片僅會記錄他們的輸贏情況。賭客難以意識到自己正不斷輸錢，只能隱約記得花了多少錢。」這段文字的主旨與下列何者最接近？","n":119,"ssz":".....................................................................................1.........1......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].items[0].options.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"欲望會創造新的發明","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].items[0].options.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"科技的進步使生活更便利","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].items[0].options.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"長期沉溺於賭博之中容易讓人迷失自我","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].items[0].options.D","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不用現金支付使人對花錢的感受變得較遲鈍","n":19,"ssz":"1..............1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請圈出轉折詞。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].items[1].answers[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"但","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].items[1].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"學生自圈，原稿無圈選痕跡","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].items[2].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"留意轉折詞之後，強調：","n":11,"ssz":".........1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].items[2].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他們用（　）玩拉霸機，卡片只會呈現輸贏狀況。","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].items[2].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"賭客比較（　）意識到輸了多少錢。","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].items[3].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據轉折詞之後的敘述，選項何者正確？","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].items[3].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"選項 (A)~(D) 印在上方那張圖片裡，不重複列","n":25,"ssz":".....................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].items[3].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色手寫字（圖形層）","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.節錄文章自112年第34~35題：","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[0].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「隱私」是一種多元流動的概念，窗簾代表一種隱私，提款卡密碼是一種 隱私，筆電防窺貼片是一種隱私。在我讀高中的年代，「隱私」意謂著上鎖的日記本、父母進房間前先敲門。","n":81,"ssz":".....2.............2..........2............2....................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[0].paragraphs[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"如今在網路上，瀏覽紀錄、按讚喜好、地理位置、基本個資等這些看不到的數據，都是商業可變現、政治可操縱的黑箱資料。","n":55,"ssz":"...............1..............1........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[0].paragraphs[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"關於網路隱私，當前最重要的挑戰是，當我們同意使用某一網路服務，形同自願交出私密資料。然而，我們完全不知道，誰可能取得這些資料，又會用在哪些地方？","n":72,"ssz":"........................................................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[0].attribution","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"——改寫自黃哲斌〈個資可以吃嗎？給現代公民的網路隱私守則〉","n":29,"ssz":"............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"留意轉折詞後面主要強調哪一項訊息？請勾選。","n":21,"ssz":"..........1.1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[2].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「隱私」在現在與過去有截然不同的定義和範圍。","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[2].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們的隱私資料在商人與政治家眼中是有價值的。","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[2].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們難以確認自己提交的隱私資料會被如何運用。","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[3].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"依據本文，下列何者最符合作者的觀點？","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[3].options.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只要使用者同意，交出資料就不算隱私問題。","n":20,"ssz":".............1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[3].options.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"網路隱私的難處，是資料交出後難以掌握去向。","n":21,"ssz":"......1.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[3].options.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"網路資料有商業價值，所以最好完全不要使用網路。","n":23,"ssz":"................1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].items[3].options.D","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"現代隱私都藏在數據中，傳統隱私已經不重要。","n":21,"ssz":".................1..."},{"section":"served:keypoints.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章運用不同的經驗來說明「轉折詞後有重點」的概念，請透過表格整理文章內容。","n":39,"ssz":"......................................."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"連結經驗","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].paragraph_range","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（段1～3）","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].items[0].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"聽別人說話時覺得自己有【　】，可以猜到下一句。","n":23,"ssz":".......1............1.."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].items[1].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「但是」之後（　）都接壞消息。","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].items[1].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一定","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].items[1].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不一定","n":3,"ssz":".1."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"提出想法","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].paragraph_range","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（段4）","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「但是」像是【　】，提醒我們要特別留意「但是」（　）的訊息。","n":30,"ssz":".............................."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"之前","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"之後","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[2].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"舉出實例","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:keypoints.row